n pixel art!<br><br></li><li> Amazing and gorgeous soundtrack!<br><br></li><li> Four different dungeons to explore!<br><br></li><li> Five challenging bosses to defeat!<br><br></li><li> Collect spells, potions, and equipment!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/904800?t=1536272788","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/904800?t=1536272788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1536272788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1536272788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"~ Ambition ~<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/extras/8fac71421613391ce926d498e481355e.webp?t=1536272788\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/extras/9b76ab89f2bf1b1c582d5d7a0bfae1f2.webp?t=1536272788\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/extras/ff6509e222e602a78a561cd80af8a232.webp?t=1536272788\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/extras/cac994e5a278a3aa83662a779a665714.webp?t=1536272788\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/904800/extras/61221cb2833fc49ddfc40ee212dc69ae.webp?t=1536272788\" width=24 height=24 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.st